window.__ICE_PAGE_PROPS__={"docDetailData":{"storeData":{"siteOverride":{"website":"cn","language":"zh"},"alias":"/open-search/search-platform/product-overview/billing-methods-and-billing-items","nodeId":null,"data":{"lastModifiedTime":1787643636000,"keywords":"了解AI搜索平台计费,AI搜索平台计费项,AI搜索平台计费规则","docTitle":"AI搜索开放平台计费方式和计费项","language":"zh","seoTitle":"AI搜索开放平台如何计费-智能开放搜索 OpenSearch(Open Search)-阿里云帮助中心","title":"AI搜索开放平台计费方式和计费项","content":"<div lang=\"zh\" class=\"icms-help-docs-content\">\n<main id=\"main-2732418\"><div id=\"f9f3f8645ao3p\" data-tag=\"body\" class=\"body\"><p id=\"1ba972b81aa4n\">通过阅读本文，您可以快速了解<span class=\"help-letter-space\"></span>AI<span class=\"help-letter-space\"></span>搜索开放平台的计费项组成、计费方式、计费规则信息。</p><h2 id=\"49142e303dqgq\" data-tag=\"p\" class=\"p\">计费项</h2><p id=\"71d3e6ecd2d8c\">AI<span class=\"help-letter-space\"></span>搜索开放平台涉及以下计费项：</p><ul id=\"bd9f655a6ehnq\"><li id=\"26fe3ddaf2x0c\"><p id=\"39607f50abgd8\"><span props=\"china\"><a href=\"#35b36156ea3bb\" id=\"14186d855euvm\" title=\"\" class=\"xref\">模型调用</a></span>：调用模型（如文档内容解析服务、文本向量化服务、排序服务等）服务产生的费用（Token<span class=\"help-letter-space\"></span>计费方式）。</p></li><li id=\"c429e38105plj\"><p id=\"5b824bd3d81vb\"><span props=\"china\"><a href=\"#c29a67e11elzv\" id=\"5605d1bfb97nk\" title=\"\" class=\"xref\">模型定制</a></span>：用户结合自有数据对<span class=\"help-letter-space\"></span>AI<span class=\"help-letter-space\"></span>搜索开放平台提供的模型进行模型定制（如<a href=\"https://help.aliyun.com/zh/open-search/search-platform/developer-reference/vector-dimensionality-reduction-service-training\" id=\"a5545ef7dfer0\" title=\"\" class=\"xref\">向量降维服务定制训练</a>）产生的费用（按模型定制实际使用的计算资源计费）。</p></li><li id=\"4fee2d12e21d4\"><p id=\"b83f54af2dfn8\"><span props=\"china\"><a href=\"#83aad3b50c0e4\" id=\"3b388a61bb0ue\" title=\"\" class=\"xref\">模型部署</a></span>：将不同渠道的模型独立部署至<span class=\"help-letter-space\"></span>AI<span class=\"help-letter-space\"></span>搜索开放平台所产生的部署和调用费用。</p></li><li id=\"058d83be3fifs\"><p id=\"38560875c62bt\"><span props=\"china\"><a href=\"#4d903cfc89qfl\" id=\"dac0b29fc2ohk\" title=\"\" class=\"xref\">服务开发</a></span>：AI<span class=\"help-letter-space\"></span>搜索开放平台集成<span class=\"help-letter-space\"></span>PAI DSW<span class=\"help-letter-space\"></span>功能，开发者可以在平台内通过<span class=\"help-letter-space\"></span><a href=\"https://help.aliyun.com/zh/pai/notebook-lab\" id=\"3e631f166fa8m\" title=\"\" class=\"xref\">Notebook</a><span class=\"help-letter-space\"></span>完成服务开发与执行。</p></li><li id=\"a3b7e2d4f8k9m\"><p id=\"c5d9e3f7g1h2j\">搜索引擎服务：包含阿里云<span class=\"help-letter-space\"></span>Elasticsearch（含<span class=\"help-letter-space\"></span>Elasticsearch Serverless）和<span class=\"help-letter-space\"></span>OpenSearch-向量检索版，采用独立计费方式，具体费用请参见各服务的计费文档。Elasticsearch Serverless<span class=\"help-letter-space\"></span>产生的费用在账单中归属<span class=\"help-letter-space\"></span>AI<span class=\"help-letter-space\"></span>搜索开放平台。</p></li></ul><div type=\"note\" id=\"b18a7589f0i3e\" class=\"note note-note\"><div class=\"note-icon-wrapper\"><i class=\"icon-note note note\"></i></div><div class=\"noteContentSpan\"><strong>说明 </strong><p id=\"10fd0b014f63u\">AI<span class=\"help-letter-space\"></span>搜索开放平台可免费开通，不使用不计费。</p></div></div><h2 id=\"07e9a6dd7bi3v\"><b>计费方式</b></h2><p id=\"145ed287eaaxg\">除搜索引擎服务外，AI<span class=\"help-letter-space\"></span>搜索开放平台均采用按量付费模式，按照服务调用量与模型定制训练实际消耗的计算时（CU）计费。每小时生成一个计费账单，所有的分时账单归属于一个订单，并按照生成订单时的账单从阿里云账号扣费。</p><div id=\"a0f3c1ed76vem\" type=\"important\" class=\"note note-important\"><div class=\"note-icon-wrapper\"><i class=\"icon-note note important\"></i></div><div class=\"noteContentSpan\"><strong>重要 </strong><p id=\"bd692946bdek4\">自<span class=\"help-letter-space\"></span>2024-07-04 17:00<span class=\"help-letter-space\"></span>起，部分服务采用阶梯计费，具体请参见以下计费规则文档。</p></div></div><section id=\"02e843d2e3gzt\" props=\"china\" data-cond-props=\"china\" class=\"section\"><h2 id=\"f30e0b2f912ry\"><b>计费规则</b></h2><h3 id=\"35b36156ea3bb\"><b>模型调用</b></h3><p id=\"e5c99d8512u9p\">在大语言模型中，Token<span class=\"help-letter-space\"></span>是模型处理和理解文本的最小单位。通常表示单词、字词、字符或符号等文本片段，不同模型可能有自己的切分方法，字符数目和<span class=\"help-letter-space\"></span>Token<span class=\"help-letter-space\"></span>数目不一定一一对应。</p><p id=\"562ee0afdfi75\">AI<span class=\"help-letter-space\"></span>搜索开放平台按服务的实际调用量计费，不同服务的计费单位不同，请以下表中的<b>计费单位</b>列为准：</p><ul id=\"e1119c2174513\"><li id=\"cb46fc28dcf60\"><p id=\"8482906028f84\"><b>元/千<span class=\"help-letter-space\"></span>tokens</b>：多数文本类服务按<span class=\"help-letter-space\"></span>Token<span class=\"help-letter-space\"></span>计费，包括文档内容解析、文档切分、文本向量化、部分排序服务与大语言模型等。其中部分服务采用<b>阶梯计费</b>，部分服务按<b>输入与输出<span class=\"help-letter-space\"></span>Token<span class=\"help-letter-space\"></span>分别计费</b>。</p></li><li id=\"19186a35a645c\"><p id=\"4c856aa5cc8cf\"><b>元/张图片</b>：图片内容解析、多模态向量化、图像识别与图像检测等服务，按处理的图片张数计费。</p></li><li id=\"2b55cac8a91bc\"><p id=\"4d332917c5be6\"><b>元/个表格</b>：文档内容解析服务中识别的表格，按表格个数计费。</p></li><li id=\"8b4ff5ec94c6e\"><p id=\"0092ca2dec0bc\"><b>元/个<span class=\"help-letter-space\"></span>docs</b>：向量降维服务与部分排序服务，按处理的文档条数计费。</p></li><li id=\"bd74596232899\"><p id=\"ba2936cfb73c7\"><b>元/千张</b>：视频抽帧服务按抽取的图片张数计费。</p></li><li id=\"2d7d2ff2f40ac\"><p id=\"8840dac34dd25\"><b>元/次、元/千次</b>：图片文本识别按调用次数计费；联网搜索按千次调用分档一口价计费。</p></li><li id=\"432c4c223b18a\"><p id=\"3a1e45b6b772a\"><b>元/小时</b>：语音识别（ASR）服务按音频时长计费。</p></li></ul><div type=\"note\" id=\"9af09d78dbqe7\" class=\"note note-note\"><div class=\"note-icon-wrapper\"><i class=\"icon-note note note\"></i></div><div class=\"noteContentSpan\"><strong>说明 </strong><p id=\"e91b6fc84a807\">部分模型支持<span class=\"help-letter-space\"></span><a href=\"https://help.aliyun.com/zh/open-search/search-platform/developer-reference/token-calculation\" id=\"09e19659078mq\" title=\"\" class=\"xref\">Token<span class=\"help-letter-space\"></span>计算</a>预估调用产生的<span class=\"help-letter-space\"></span>Token<span class=\"help-letter-space\"></span>数。</p></div></div><p id=\"c94511ed09tul\"><b>阶梯计费示例</b>：</p><p id=\"c8bc433a150wa\">调用文本稀疏向量服务，产生了<span class=\"help-letter-space\"></span>1000000<span class=\"help-letter-space\"></span>个<span class=\"help-letter-space\"></span>token，共计为<span class=\"help-letter-space\"></span>1000<span class=\"help-letter-space\"></span>个计费单位，则计费为：500*0.006+500*0.0006=3.3<span class=\"help-letter-space\"></span>元</p><p id=\"fd903f1e93h9n\"><b>输入输出计费示例</b>：</p><p id=\"ed7d34d4fd8do\">调用大语言模型<span class=\"help-letter-space\"></span>qwen3-235b-a22b，产生了输入与输出各<span class=\"help-letter-space\"></span>1000<span class=\"help-letter-space\"></span>个<span class=\"help-letter-space\"></span>token，则计费为：</p><p id=\"d8ff14a0ffsdt\">1*0.004+1*0.04=0.044<span class=\"help-letter-space\"></span>元</p><section id=\"3a85d28be2asc\" data-tag=\"tabbed-content-box\" outputclass=\"tabbed-content-box\" class=\"tabbed-content-box section\"><section id=\"a5c6fe0f88bls\" class=\"section\"><h4 id=\"50c5b89792epc\">华东<span class=\"help-letter-space\"></span>2（上海）地域</h4><table id=\"fa6e7202c9wss\" tablewidth=\"100\" tablecolswidth=\"18.69 29.35 13.55 18.69 19.72\" autofit=\"true\" class=\"table\"><colgroup colwidth=\"0.93*\" style=\"width:18.69%\"></colgroup><colgroup colwidth=\"1.47*\" style=\"width:29.35%\"></colgroup><colgroup colwidth=\"0.68*\" style=\"width:13.55%\"></colgroup><colgroup colwidth=\"0.93*\" style=\"width:18.69%\"></colgroup><colgroup colwidth=\"0.99*\" style=\"width:19.72%\"></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\"><tr id=\"443f678c903le\"><td id=\"7cac6a4d26i9e\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"background-color:#e5e5e5\" colspan=\"1\"><p id=\"f9cc93390aytm\"><b>模型名称</b></p></td><td id=\"fed06bae664c4\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"background-color:#e5e5e5\" colspan=\"1\"><p id=\"55cd521570hm8\"><b>模型<span class=\"help-letter-space\"></span>ID</b></p></td><td id=\"ac1de2534au0r\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"background-color:#e5e5e5\" colspan=\"1\"><p id=\"89e06107e96h9\"><b>计费单位</b></p></td><td id=\"7f31a7c15aafs\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"background-color:#e5e5e5\" colspan=\"1\"><p id=\"9e4a428354f4w\"><b>0-500<span class=\"help-letter-space\"></span>个单位定价</b></p></td><td id=\"ddc5d1aaef0zg\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"background-color:#e5e5e5\" colspan=\"1\"><p id=\"78ee386f10jgx\"><b>超出<span class=\"help-letter-space\"></span>500<span class=\"help-letter-space\"></span>个单位定价</b></p></td></tr><tr id=\"f756256583lep\" style=\"height:67px\"><td id=\"e49723f8a1aon\" rowspan=\"5\" colspan=\"1\"><p id=\"02a563c59acx3\"><a href=\"https://help.aliyun.com/zh/open-search/search-platform/developer-reference/api-details\" id=\"1db83a80253jg\" title=\"\" class=\"xref\">文档内容解析</a></p></td><td id=\"fd1af98983j0r\" rowspan=\"4\" colspan=\"1\"><p id=\"ff109e6e84z63\">ops-document-analyze-001</p></td><td id=\"430aa4c7afplu\" rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\"><p id=\"4c892009b0i29\">元/千<span class=\"help-letter-space\"></span>tokens</p></td><td id=\"601574b323eii\" rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\"><p id=\"e1cae7ea05e9w\">0.005 </p></td><td id=\"690c832d057zv\" rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\"><p id=\"46423c7763470\">0.002</p></td></tr><tr id=\"d86fcf395aooh\"><td id=\"f557d538a2p5m\" rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\"><p id=\"14b4353d84k11\">元/张图片</p></td><td id=\"4378c58d19ca7\" rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"2\"><p id=\"928b06d5b8x5t\">0.006</p></td></tr><tr id=\"1c7c831c9dmnr\"><td id=\"d9f4e0db34i45\" rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\"><p id=\"9ef5abdcfasox\">元/个表格</p></td><td id=\"406d34adf3c4u\" rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"2\"><p id=\"d769570c3da2f\">0.012</p></td></tr><tr id=\"cd22641a68f7n\"><td id=\"00c6f1e17c3i6\" rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\"><p id=\"e305674d11lj6\">元/千<span class=\"help-letter-space\"></span>tokens</p></td><td id=\"2f55adc1b4hvw\" rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"2\"><p id=\"943c5b10c6uqo\">0.002</p><blockquote id=\"a9060d502d26p\">调用文档内容解析服务时通过参数控制是否启用基于语义理解的文档层级结构提取功能，启用后，除产生文档解析费用以外，该功能按照<span class=\"help-letter-space\"></span>0.002<span class=\"help-letter-space\"></span>元/千<span class=\"help-letter-space\"></span>tokens<span class=\"help-letter-space\"></span>计费。</blockquote></td></tr><tr id=\"c969bf8cc2yln\"><td id=\"7b7a10d118l7e\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align:middle\" colspan=\"1\"><p id=\"da153fd06agbs\">ops-document-analyze-002</p></td><td id=\"fb596f1d80w7g\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align:middle\" colspan=\"1\"><p id=\"4099ae3720mr8\">元/千<span class=\"help-letter-space\"></span>tokens</p></td><td id=\"7735e52a87nmi\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align:middle\" colspan=\"1\"><p id=\"147d818f34wky\">0.17</p></td><td id=\"cf83cbcacei1h\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"vertical-align:middle\" colspan=\"1\"><p id=\"79bc1f2639ngj\">0.017</p></td></tr><tr id=\"f5b37b8a5d1xo\"><td id=\"916e6ef726seh\" rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\"><p id=\"b55c9146f2vc0\"><a href=\"https://help.aliyun.com/zh/open-search/search-platform/developer-reference/opensearch-api-details\" id=\"b949cb97f9g7r\" title=\"\" class=\"xref\">图片文本识别</a></p></td><td id=\"614d3c6f10w4d\" rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\"><p id=\"d6a849b506q1y\">ops-image-analyze-ocr-001</p></td><td id=\"4f97b9ed4bjmg\" rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\"><p id=\"73a5268337w88\">元/次</p></td><td id=\"755c8f59f8y5m\" rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\"><p id=\"e59a0848a23lt\">0.08</p></td><td id=\"890998f394zmj\" rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\"><p id=\"8c69286649vbk\">0.02</p></td></tr><tr id=\"067be9805493c\"><td id=\"e49d95061ctkw\" rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\"><p id=\"8ec5e046e2ujj\"><a href=\"https://help.aliyun.com/zh/open-search/search-platform/developer-reference/opensearch-api-details\" id=\"3c8c312fech2h\" title=\"\" class=\"xref\">图片内容理解</a></p></td><td id=\"72942ed6f9068\" rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\"><p id=\"97eba1eb6eemz\">ops-image-analyze-vlm-001</p></td><td id=\"bd667e0bed0x1\" rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\"><p id=\"0b1b8ca455001\">元/千<span class=\"help-letter-space\"></span>tokens</p></td><td id=\"41e608050bija\" rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"2\"><p id=\"de140b93370zf\">0.02</p></td></tr><tr id=\"7b1882ba08p66\"><td id=\"f174b067d3ztp\" rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\"><p id=\"4572b2bc9dolm\"><a href=\"https://help.aliyun.com/z