"1\"><p id=\"388bd043f8lbf\">元/小时</p></td><td id=\"1cdb40b02d9rf\" rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"2\"><p id=\"8e85046c55ui2\">0.57</p></td></tr><tr id=\"5177d6d90efw1\"><td id=\"2796d6d80cdka\" rowspan=\"2\" colspan=\"1\"><p id=\"5105954063fq7\">搜索引擎</p></td><td id=\"02722791e7yws\" rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"4\"><p id=\"ceaa8995175r3\">阿里云<span class=\"help-letter-space\"></span>Elasticsearch（含<span class=\"help-letter-space\"></span>Elasticsearch Serverless）：基于开源<span class=\"help-letter-space\"></span>Elasticsearch<span class=\"help-letter-space\"></span>构建的全托管云服务，100%兼容开源功能的同时，支持开箱即用、按需付费。Elasticsearch Serverless<span class=\"help-letter-space\"></span>产生的<span class=\"help-letter-space\"></span>API<span class=\"help-letter-space\"></span>调用费用在账单中归属<span class=\"help-letter-space\"></span>AI<span class=\"help-letter-space\"></span>搜索开放平台。详情请参见<a href=\"https://help.aliyun.com/zh/es/product-overview/elasticsearch-billable-items\" id=\"a6b7bf03cehwz\" title=\"\" class=\"xref\">阿里云<span class=\"help-letter-space\"></span>ES</a>。</p></td></tr><tr id=\"9a1d722a55qxr\"><td id=\"57a0afa106d18\" rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"4\"><p id=\"7b00aea75emu5\">OpenSearch-向量检索版：计费详情请参见<a href=\"https://help.aliyun.com/zh/open-search/vector-search-edition/billing-overview-of-vector-search-edition\" id=\"8abecd1a9dpih\" title=\"\" class=\"xref\">向量检索版</a>。</p></td></tr><tr id=\"3cdb9845697lg\"><td id=\"c0fb29a4cfshq\" rowspan=\"14\" colspan=\"1\"><p id=\"01b6f7209aycw\"></p><p id=\"8fa4ba9d70v65\"></p><p id=\"9846a6caeb073\"><a href=\"https://help.aliyun.com/zh/open-search/search-platform/user-guide/experience-center#aae725cfcfsrh\" id=\"71eaf8895etmb\" title=\"\" class=\"xref\">大语言模型（LLM）</a></p></td><td id=\"bb451d2fccmg0\" rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\"><p id=\"a5ca143b0axi2\">qwen3-235b-a22b</p></td><td id=\"67d0a5764f6h9\" rowspan=\"14\" colspan=\"1\"><p id=\"584f4252696oq\"></p><p id=\"581b22a217zwc\"></p><p id=\"cec2aa3308r1x\">元/千<span class=\"help-letter-space\"></span>tokens</p><p id=\"d8f